'''Divan's Gateway''' is a [[Location]] in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Divan's Gateway''' serves as a bridge connecting the {{Zone|Cliffside Veins}} to the {{Zone|Great Ice Wall}}. It overlooks {{Zone|The Mist}}.

A {{MobSprite|Powder Ghast}} and [[Raffle]] have a chance to spawn in '''Divan's Gateway'''.

